  "body": "3 Beds 2 Baths 1 Car\r\nExperience modern coastal living in the heart of Orewa with this brand new home ready to receive you. Thoughtfully designed for comfort, style, and low maintenance living, this home offers:\r\nKey Features\r\n•3 double bedrooms, including a master suite with walk in wardrobe and ensuite\r\n•2 contemporary bathrooms featuring quality fittings\r\n•Open plan living and dining flowing seamlessly to outdoor entertaining\r\n•Modern kitchen with quality appliances and functional layout\r\n•Single internal access garage for added convenience and security\r\nLocated in a highly sought after Orewa neighbourhood, you’ll enjoy close proximity to stunning beaches, local cafés, schools, parks, and easy motorway access — the perfect blend of lifestyle and convenience. The development has been master planned for consistency, with landscaped green spaces and a family-friendly feel throughout.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a first home buyer, downsizer, or investor, this property represents outstanding value in one of Auckland’s most desirable coastal communities.\r\nEnquire today — opportunities like this don’t last long in Orewa.\r\nConjunctional welcome.",
